{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國國會中期選舉最新戰況：根據美媒報道，民主黨於北卡羅萊納州「翻盤」，由Roy Cooper擊敗共和黨Michael Whaley奪得參議院議席。</p><p>此外，代表喬治亞州的民主黨籍參議員Jon Ossoff連任成功。</p><p>兩人為民主黨爭奪參院控制權拿下重要兩席。</p><p>另外，共和黨Byron Donalds成為佛羅里達州首名非裔州長，而民主黨Keisha Lance Bottoms則是美國首名非裔女性州長，以及喬治亞州首名女性和非裔州長。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T03:24:56.026681+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":214,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T02:35:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T03:18:23.413796+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T03:18:23.413796+00:00","content_hash":"97ca7ae194365bfda4b13e201ffe005e2210474969f17a33393aec2aa1c62cb9","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}